        {
            "name": "ADMIN AUTH",
            "description": "Admin authentication endpoints (cookie-based tokens for web, tokens not returned in login response body). Supports SUPER_ADMIN and ADMIN roles.",
            "item": [
                {
                    "name": "Signup",
                    "request": {
                        "method": "POST",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Content-Type",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            }
                        ],
                        "body": {
                            "mode": "raw",
                            "raw": "{\n  \"fullName\": \"Admin User\",\n  \"email\": \"admin@example.com\",\n  \"mobile\": \"9876543210\",\n  \"password\": \"AdminPass123!\"\n}"
                        },
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/admin/auth/signup",
                            "host": ["{{BASE_URL}}"],
                            "path": ["api", "v1", "admin", "auth", "signup"]
                        },
                        "description": "Admin signup with email + password. NO OTP required - can login immediately.\n\nRole rules:\n- Default role is USER (if role not provided)\n- role ∈ {\"SUPER_ADMIN\", \"ADMIN\", \"USER\"} (optional field)\n- SUPER_ADMIN can only be created by existing SUPER_ADMIN (requires Authorization header with SUPER_ADMIN token)\n- ADMIN can only be created by existing SUPER_ADMIN (requires Authorization header with SUPER_ADMIN token)\n- If unauthenticated or role not provided, defaults to USER\n\nExample: To create ADMIN, send Authorization: Bearer <SUPER_ADMIN_TOKEN> header with role: \"ADMIN\" in body."
                    },
                    "response": [
                        {
                            "name": "Success Response",
                            "originalRequest": {
                                "method": "POST",
                                "header": [
                                    {
                                        "key": "Content-Type",
                                        "value": "application/json"
                                    }
                                ],
                                "body": {
                                    "mode": "raw",
                                    "raw": "{\n  \"fullName\": \"Admin User\",\n  \"email\": \"admin@example.com\",\n  \"mobile\": \"9876543210\",\n  \"password\": \"AdminPass123!\"\n}"
                                },
                                "url": {
                                    "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/admin/auth/signup",
                                    "host": ["{{BASE_URL}}"],
                                    "path": [
                                        "api",
                                        "v1",
                                        "admin",
                                        "auth",
                                        "signup"
                                    ]
                                }
                            },
                            "status": "Created",
                            "code": 201,
                            "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
                            "header": [
                                {
                                    "key": "Content-Type",
                                    "value": "application/json"
                                }
                            ],
                            "body": "{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"message\": \"Account created successfully. You can now login.\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"userId\": \"123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000\",\n    \"email\": \"admin@example.com\"\n  },\n  \"requestId\": \"req-123456\",\n  \"code\": \"SIGNUP_SUCCESS\"\n}"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "name": "Login (Admin, Cookie-based)",
                    "request": {
                        "method": "POST",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Content-Type",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            }
                        ],
                        "body": {
                            "mode": "raw",
                            "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"AdminPass123!\"\n}"
                        },
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/admin/auth/login",
                            "host": ["{{BASE_URL}}"],
                            "path": ["api", "v1", "admin", "auth", "login"]
                        },
                        "description": "Admin login with email + password (supports SUPER_ADMIN and ADMIN).\n\nFor web:\n- Server sets httpOnly cookies: accessToken (short-lived), refreshToken (long-lived).\n- Tokens are NOT returned in the JSON body.\n- Response includes actorType instead of role.\n\nIn Postman, enable \"Automatically follow redirects\" and check the \"Cookies\" tab after calling this endpoint to inspect the cookies."
                    },
                    "response": [
                        {
                            "name": "Success Response (cookies set, no tokens in body)",
                            "originalRequest": {
                                "method": "POST",
                                "header": [
                                    {
                                        "key": "Content-Type",
                                        "value": "application/json"
                                    }
                                ],
                                "body": {
                                    "mode": "raw",
                                    "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"AdminPass123!\"\n}"
                                },
                                "url": {
                                    "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/admin/auth/login",
                                    "host": ["{{BASE_URL}}"],
                                    "path": [
                                        "api",
                                        "v1",
                                        "admin",
                                        "auth",
                                        "login"
                                    ]
                                }
                            },
                            "status": "OK",
                            "code": 200,
                            "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
                            "header": [
                                {
                                    "key": "Content-Type",
                                    "value": "application/json"
                                },
                                {
                                    "key": "Set-Cookie",
                                    "value": "accessToken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...; HttpOnly; SameSite=Lax"
                                },
                                {
                                    "key": "Set-Cookie-2",
                                    "value": "refreshToken=abc123def456ghi789jkl012mno345pqr678stu901vwx234yz; HttpOnly; SameSite=Lax"
                                }
                            ],
                            "body": "{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"message\": \"Login successful\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"id\": \"123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000\",\n    \"email\": \"admin@example.com\",\n    \"fullName\": \"Admin User\",\n    \"actorType\": \"ADMIN\",\n    \"isActive\": true\n  },\n  \"requestId\": \"req-123456\",\n  \"code\": \"LOGIN_SUCCESS\"\n}"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "name": "Refresh Token (Admin)",
                    "request": {
                        "method": "POST",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Content-Type",
                                "value": "application/json",
                                "description": "For Postman testing, you can still send refreshToken in body. For web, server prefers the httpOnly refreshToken cookie."
                            }
                        ],
                        "body": {
                            "mode": "raw",
                            "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{REFRESH_TOKEN}}\"\n}"
                        },
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/admin/auth/refresh",
                            "host": ["{{BASE_URL}}"],
                            "path": ["api", "v1", "admin", "auth", "refresh"]
                        },
                        "description": "Refresh access token using refresh token.\n\nBackend behavior:\n- Reads refreshToken from cookie first (if present), otherwise from request body.\n- Returns new accessToken & refreshToken in response body (for system/proxy usage)."
                    },
                    "response": [
                        {
                            "name": "Success Response",
                            "originalRequest": {
                                "method": "POST",
                                "header": [
                                    {
                                        "key": "Content-Type",
                                        "value": "application/json"
                                    }
                                ],
                                "body": {
                                    "mode": "raw",
                                    "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{REFRESH_TOKEN}}\"\n}"
                                },
                                "url": {
                                    "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/admin/auth/refresh",
                                    "host": ["{{BASE_URL}}"],
                                    "path": [
                                        "api",
                                        "v1",
                                        "admin",
                                        "auth",
                                        "refresh"
                                    ]
                                }
                            },
                            "status": "OK",
                            "code": 200,
                            "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
                            "header": [
                                {
                                    "key": "Content-Type",
                                    "value": "application/json"
                                }
                            ],
                            "body": "{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"message\": \"Tokens refreshed successfully\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"accessToken\": \"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...\",\n    \"refreshToken\": \"new_refresh_token_abc123def456ghi789jkl012mno345pqr678stu901vwx234yz\"\n  },\n  \"requestId\": \"req-123456\",\n  \"code\": \"TOKEN_REFRESHED\"\n}"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "name": "Logout (Admin)",
                    "request": {
                        "method": "POST",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Content-Type",
                                "value": "application/json",
                                "description": "Body is optional for web clients; backend reads refreshToken from cookie first."
                            }
                        ],
                        "body": {
                            "mode": "raw",
                            "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{REFRESH_TOKEN}}\"\n}"
                        },
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/admin/auth/logout",
                            "host": ["{{BASE_URL}}"],
                            "path": ["api", "v1", "admin", "auth", "logout"]
                        },
                        "description": "Logout current device.\n- Server reads refreshToken from cookie first, then from body.\n- Revokes that refresh token if present.\n- Always clears accessToken and refreshToken cookies."
                    },
                    "response": [
                        {
                            "name": "Success Response (cookies cleared)",
                            "originalRequest": {
                                "method": "POST",
                                "header": [
                                    {
                                        "key": "Content-Type",
                                        "value": "application/json"
                                    }
                                ],
                                "body": {
                                    "mode": "raw",
                                    "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{REFRESH_TOKEN}}\"\n}"
                                },
                                "url": {
                                    "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/admin/auth/logout",
                                    "host": ["{{BASE_URL}}"],
                                    "path": [
                                        "api",
                                        "v1",
                                        "admin",
                                        "auth",
                                        "logout"
                                    ]
                                }
                            },
                            "status": "OK",
                            "code": 200,
                            "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
                            "header": [
                                {
                                    "key": "Content-Type",
                                    "value": "application/json"
                                },
                                {
                                    "key": "Set-Cookie",
                                    "value": "accessToken=; Max-Age=0; HttpOnly; SameSite=Lax"
                                },
                                {
                                    "key": "Set-Cookie-2",
                                    "value": "refreshToken=; Max-Age=0; HttpOnly; SameSite=Lax"
                                }
                            ],
                            "body": "{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"message\": \"Logged out successfully\",\n  \"data\": null,\n  \"requestId\": \"req-123456\",\n  \"code\": \"LOGOUT_SUCCESS\"\n}"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "name": "Logout All (Admin)",
                    "request": {
                        "method": "POST",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Content-Type",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            },
                            {
                                "key": "Authorization",
                                "value": "Bearer {{ACCESS_TOKEN}}",
                                "description": "For header-based auth. With web cookie auth, omit this header and let cookies carry the accessToken."
                            }
                        ],
                        "body": {
                            "mode": "raw",
                            "raw": ""
                        },
